        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joseph Benavidez, Urijah Faber, Junya Kodo, Norifumi Yamamoto\n- Organizations: WEC, Ultimate Fighting Championship, DREAM\n- Roles: mixed martial artists, featherweight, bantamweight, training partner, champion\n- Events: DREAM 5 Lightweight GP Final 2008\n\nFacts:\n- Urijah Faber was born on May 14, 1979, and he is an American retired mixed martial artist.\n- Urijah Faber fought as a bantamweight and featherweight in the Ultimate Fighting Championship.\n- Urijah Faber was a former WEC Featherweight Champion.\n- Joseph Benavidez's fighting style has drawn comparisons to his training partner Urijah Faber.\n- Junya Kodo replaced Norifumi Yamamoto on 2 days' notice to fight Joseph Benavidez at DREAM 5 Lightweight GP Final 2008.",
